                  <strong>Service Parallel Thermoplastic</strong> design - a flat, two-conductor cord commonly used for light-duty indoor
                  applications such as lamps, small appliances, and light-duty extension cords.
                  </p>
                  <p style="font-size: 1.4rem;">The "parallel" means the two wires run side-by-side in a flat shape rather than twisted or round.</p>
