                    <li><strong>SPT-1</strong> : Thinner insulation, lower amp rating, more flexible; used for light-duty indoor use.</li>
                    <li><strong>SPT-2</strong> : Thicker insulation, slightly higher amp rating, more durable; suitable for moderate indoor use.</li>
                    <li><strong>SPT-3</strong> : Even thicker insulation; designed for heavier-duty indoor applications. </li>                    
